    "complete_contract_identity": "Every ordered row ID, PlanId and contract SHA agrees for both complete55 contexts against current actual export and retained SourceJ context. All four repinned subjects retain their exact11/43 scientific scope and original limitations. Their draft/null review fields were not treated as acceptance."
