    "arena": "All nine addressed row-owned tape cases at7961, actual player1/legal-uniform opponent and unchanged game-aware search/horizon/pass/draw rules. Exact score(2wins+draws)/18 strictly improves initial and separately beats both actual plain legal-uniform and neutral-prior zero-value MCTS controls. Reference equality only when actual reference and final are both exact1 from complete outcomes. Legal constraints, unchanged quality bars and0.5 exclusion remain; no selected subset or rounded equality.",
    "ars_and_sac": "ARS remains honest host-Double linear search, binding the whole actually applied aggregate-step lineage; favorable perturbations or unrelated neural witnesses are insufficient. SAC/pendulum preparation including340000 warm Adam applications remains distinct and retained; scheduled-learning gain begins from authentic effective initialization after preparation.",
    "tuning_context": "hyperparameter-tuning remains context only in every complete55: seed1729/trials128, unchanged contract and original full-lane admission obligations. No tuning learning result is endorsed and its explicitly absent original code source is not invented.",
    "physical_boundary": "Mathematical raw comparisons, source/contract equality and parsed review DATA prove no actual producer. Before-dependent-work durable boundaries, original source/process/invocation, prelaunch review selection identity, complete attempts/reference/child retention, real selected hardware/toolchain, exact served Store bytes and full original qualification/journal/lane authentication remain separate obligations. CPU and Apple evidence cannot substitute for each other; later NVIDIA/three-lane admission remains separate."
